repository-code: "https://github.com/yuhu08/MOSES-TC"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  MOSES-TC selects a subset of synthetic tropical cyclone tracks to match
  target marginal distributions at multiple grid points. This release includes
  the Python implementation and a historical western North Pacific example
  with prepared IBTrACS and ACCESS-CM2 tracks for 1979–2014. The MIT License
  applies to the code. Bundled data retain their respective source terms and
  attribution, as described in data/README.md.
